Below is an all-in-one HTML file that implements an “advanced” notepad app. It features a resizable editor with line numbers, rudimentary syntax‐highlighting (for JavaScript, HTML, and CSS), dark/light theme switching, file “New/Open/Save,” basic auto‐indentation, a find/replace panel, status info, and local‐storage auto–save. (Keep in mind that syntax highlighting uses regexes so it isn’t as “smart” as a full editor library—but it shows the idea.) You can simply copy the code into an .html file and open it in your browser.

